
===== L1 git ':path' (empty rev) reads the INDEX, not a commit =====
PROBE L1.commit-versions                                 COMMITTED
PROBE L1.index-version(:path)                            STAGED-BUT-NOT-COMMITTED

===== L2 the counter with --rev '' measures the INDEX of the lane =====
PROBE L2.rc                                              0
PROBE L2.PASS                                            C1_R93_PASS=true
PROBE L2.summary-rev-field                               rev=

===== L3 driver control states are built from the lane WORKING TREE, not from --rev =====
PROBE L3.driver-rc                                       0
PROBE L3.receipt-note-has-worktree-marker                0
PROBE L3.receipt-note-has-rev-marker                     0 (the rev's note has none)
PROBE L3.cloned-fixture-note-has-marker                  
PROBE L3.receipt-verdict-tables                          verdict_tables=1
PROBE L3.PASS-line                                       C1_R93_PASS=true

===== L4 same, but the working-tree note is mutated to a HOSTILE shape (extra verdict table) =====
PROBE L4.driver-rc                                       0
PROBE L4.PASS-line                                       C1_R93_PASS=true
PROBE L4.verdict-tables                                  verdict_tables=1
PROBE L4.note-the-control-was-supposed-to-certify        the committed note at REV (not the working tree)

===== done =====
